{"schema":"rebang.page/1","platform":"jike","key":"all","page":1,"pages":3,"total":90,"has_more":true,"items":[{"id":"jike-bb668784-6bbc-456d-989c-1f8e90f6fd95:https://m.okjike.com/originalPosts/6b06bb50152f4ef8b8ac49f4","kind":"post","channel":null,"source_id":"jike-bb668784-6bbc-456d-989c-1f8e90f6fd95","source_name":"王帅真","title":"","summary":"claude 是不是要发新模型了，感觉 Opus 5.5 变蠢了啊...一个问题改了好几遍都不行（开新会话也没用） 换 Neon 一把就 get 到问题点给改了。。。","body":"claude 是不是要发新模型了，感觉 Opus 5.5 变蠢了啊...一个问题改了好几遍都不行（开新会话也没用）\n\n换 Neon 一把就 get 到问题点给改了。。。","url":"https://m.okjike.com/originalPosts/6b06bb50152f4ef8b8ac49f4","image":null,"published_at":"2026-11-25T18:41:20+08:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T06:09:34+08:00","lang":"zh","blogger":{"platform":"jike","handle":"bb668784-6bbc-456d-989c-1f8e90f6fd95","display_name":"王帅真","media":[],"quote":null,"avatar":"https://cdnv2.ruguoapp.com/FruN09TgXgxjfRo8YYmQd7nAo0g9v3.jpg?imageMogr2/auto-orient/heic-exif/1/format/jpeg/thumbnail/!1000x1000r/gravity/Center/crop/!1000x1000a0a0"},"translated":false},{"id":"jike-160F8D03-E580-4799-8D02-B86B1A6FBF64:https://m.okjike.com/originalPosts/6b065b1d136b2761c6e01853","kind":"post","channel":null,"source_id":"jike-160F8D03-E580-4799-8D02-B86B1A6FBF64","source_name":"范冰_XDash","title":"","summary":"学到了，原来「卡黄CP」是指「显卡」和「黄仁勋」。那他们真的复合了。","body":"学到了，原来「卡黄CP」是指「显卡」和「黄仁勋」。那他们真的复合了。","url":"https://m.okjike.com/originalPosts/6b065b1d136b2761c6e01853","image":null,"published_at":"2026-11-25T11:50:53+08:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T06:09:34+08:00","lang":"zh","blogger":{"platform":"jike","handle":"160F8D03-E580-4799-8D02-B86B1A6FBF64","display_name":"范冰_XDash","media":[],"quote":null,"avatar":"https://cdnv2.ruguoapp.com/Foka9bVHVUlqs39pQ-QN5kg6Mu3kv3.jpg?imageMogr2/auto-orient/heic-exif/1/format/jpeg/thumbnail/!1000x1000r/gravity/Center/crop/!1000x1000a0a0"},"translated":false},{"id":"jike-bb668784-6bbc-456d-989c-1f8e90f6fd95:https://m.okjike.com/originalPosts/6b053704136b2761c6c1b137","kind":"post","channel":null,"source_id":"jike-bb668784-6bbc-456d-989c-1f8e90f6fd95","source_name":"王帅真","title":"","summary":"这...这就是中国 Muse 吗？ 如果下沉到老百姓真的就说几句话就把车打了、话费充了、东西卖了等等，还很了解我的近况，那互联网会不会要姓字节了（bushi","body":"这...这就是中国 Muse 吗？\n\n如果下沉到老百姓真的就说几句话就把车打了、话费充了、东西卖了等等，还很了解我的近况，那互联网会不会要姓字节了（bushi","url":"https://m.okjike.com/originalPosts/6b053704136b2761c6c1b137","image":{"url":"https://cdnv2.ruguoapp.com/Fr_eadCG8B_nhXC-9SIKd5ecwtmUv3.png?imageMogr2/meta-keep-list/ZXhpZixVc2VyQ29tbWVudA==/auto-orient/thumbnail/1080x%3E"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T15:04:36+08:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T06:09:34+08:00","lang":"zh","blogger":{"platform":"jike","handle":"bb668784-6bbc-456d-989c-1f8e90f6fd95","display_name":"王帅真","media":[{"type":"image","url":"https://cdnv2.ruguoapp.com/Fr_eadCG8B_nhXC-9SIKd5ecwtmUv3.png?imageMogr2/meta-keep-list/ZXhpZixVc2VyQ29tbWVudA==/auto-orient/thumbnail/1080x%3E"},{"type":"image","url":"https://cdnv2.ruguoapp.com/FiK649nH6auSusf1NJnZUIiyJA-Xv3.png?imageMogr2/meta-keep-list/ZXhpZixVc2VyQ29tbWVudA==/auto-orient/thumbnail/1080x%3E"}],"quote":null,"avatar":"https://cdnv2.ruguoapp.com/FruN09TgXgxjfRo8YYmQd7nAo0g9v3.jpg?imageMogr2/auto-orient/heic-exif/1/format/jpeg/thumbnail/!1000x1000r/gravity/Center/crop/!1000x1000a0a0"},"translated":false},{"id":"jike-bb668784-6bbc-456d-989c-1f8e90f6fd95:https://m.okjike.com/reposts/6b0536d53f85e4eb5855b568","kind":"post","channel":null,"source_id":"jike-bb668784-6bbc-456d-989c-1f8e90f6fd95","source_name":"王帅真","title":"","summary":"经典的 JTBD 理论里面说，同一波人买奶昔，早上可能是自己上班通勤路上的 time-killer 和顶饿的，傍晚可能就是买给孩子的（“好父母凭证”），其实是两个场景，两种需求","body":"经典的 JTBD 理论里面说，同一波人买奶昔，早上可能是自己上班通勤路上的 time-killer 和顶饿的，傍晚可能就是买给孩子的（“好父母凭证”），其实是两个场景，两种需求","url":"https://m.okjike.com/reposts/6b0536d53f85e4eb5855b568","image":null,"published_at":"2026-11-24T15:03:49+08:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T06:09:34+08:00","lang":"zh","blogger":{"platform":"jike","handle":"bb668784-6bbc-456d-989c-1f8e90f6fd95","display_name":"王帅真","media":[],"quote":{"handle":"14BE6DDB-0744-477B-AD83-CCCEF5EA4302","display_name":"潘乱","text":"不要围绕人群做产品，要围绕需求。\n\n移动互联网如此，AI 创业也当如此。","url":"https://m.okjike.com/users/14BE6DDB-0744-477B-AD83-CCCEF5EA4302"},"avatar":"https://cdnv2.ruguoapp.com/FruN09TgXgxjfRo8YYmQd7nAo0g9v3.jpg?imageMogr2/auto-orient/heic-exif/1/format/jpeg/thumbnail/!1000x1000r/gravity/Center/crop/!1000x1000a0a0"},"translated":false},{"id":"jike-bb668784-6bbc-456d-989c-1f8e90f6fd95:https://m.okjike.com/originalPosts/6b05262838389f5993a54ad9","kind":"post","channel":null,"source_id":"jike-bb668784-6bbc-456d-989c-1f8e90f6fd95","source_name":"王帅真","title":"","summary":"希望不是最后一次支持雷总... 作为前米粉，这次真的还挺喜欢 18 fold 的，做工确实好（除了扬声器位置是真诡异）。 for uu 远程、 for 爽刷视频、for 爽看文章/书，for 微信双端登录（能作为 pad）；同时也满足了我喜欢矮胖的小屏手机。 希望系统别让我失望吧... 买过最贵的一台手机了Ծ‸Ծ","body":"希望不是最后一次支持雷总...\n\n作为前米粉，这次真的还挺喜欢 18 fold 的，做工确实好（除了扬声器位置是真诡异）。\n\nfor uu 远程、 for 爽刷视频、for 爽看文章/书，for 微信双端登录（能作为 pad）；同时也满足了我喜欢矮胖的小屏手机。\n\n希望系统别让我失望吧... 买过最贵的一台手机了Ծ‸Ծ","url":"https://m.okjike.com/originalPosts/6b05262838389f5993a54ad9","image":{"url":"https://cdnv2.ruguoapp.com/FlrTdf6eVbb-xOr9ufrzOWVLJDaDv3.jpg"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T13:52:40+08:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T06:09:34+08:00","lang":"zh","blogger":{"platform":"jike","handle":"bb668784-6bbc-456d-989c-1f8e90f6fd95","display_name":"王帅真","media":[{"type":"image","url":"https://cdnv2.ruguoapp.com/FlrTdf6eVbb-xOr9ufrzOWVLJDaDv3.jpg"},{"type":"image","url":"https://cdnv2.ruguoapp.com/Fscs9xP5y39xE-tTkJXcak8IsKhTv3.jpg"}],"quote":null,"avatar":"https://cdnv2.ruguoapp.com/FruN09TgXgxjfRo8YYmQd7nAo0g9v3.jpg?imageMogr2/auto-orient/heic-exif/1/format/jpeg/thumbnail/!1000x1000r/gravity/Center/crop/!1000x1000a0a0"},"translated":false},{"id":"jike-7B1385A9-FCC9-4446-B8CE-472EAF6817B2:https://m.okjike.com/originalPosts/6b050fef5bf736d2104a7e20","kind":"post","channel":null,"source_id":"jike-7B1385A9-FCC9-4446-B8CE-472EAF6817B2","source_name":"少楠Plidezus","title":"","summary":"虽然是个步行模拟器，但是有很多启发都来自自小岛秀夫的《死亡搁浅》（太爱这个游戏） - 开场的镜头推拉，以及到地标的拉远镜头。 - 点击屏幕可以查看规划的路径，类似 Odradek 扫描效果。 - 可以异步联机，和其他人相遇。 - 走的路多了，会有一些痕迹。就像山里走出来的小路。 当然，任天堂的游戏也给了很多启发 - 风之杖的艺术风格 - 荒野之息的神庙密度安排和音效 - 动物森友会的现实时间系统和…","body":"虽然是个步行模拟器，但是有很多启发都来自自小岛秀夫的《死亡搁浅》（太爱这个游戏）\n\n- 开场的镜头推拉，以及到地标的拉远镜头。\n\n- 点击屏幕可以查看规划的路径，类似 Odradek 扫描效果。\n\n- 可以异步联机，和其他人相遇。\n\n- 走的路多了，会有一些痕迹。就像山里走出来的小路。\n\n当然，任天堂的游戏也给了很多启发\n\n- 风之杖的艺术风格\n\n- 荒野之息的神庙密度安排和音效\n\n- 动物森友会的现实时间系统和倒计时，以及换装系统\n\n有想内测的朋友么？","url":"https://m.okjike.com/originalPosts/6b050fef5bf736d2104a7e20","image":null,"published_at":"2026-11-24T12:17:51+08:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T06:09:34+08:00","lang":"zh","blogger":{"platform":"jike","handle":"7B1385A9-FCC9-4446-B8CE-472EAF6817B2","display_name":"少楠Plidezus","media":[],"quote":null,"avatar":"https://cdnv2.ruguoapp.com/FmtwuafewTTtdX3XezBXlN2OsOvDv3.jpg?imageMogr2/auto-orient/heic-exif/1/format/jpeg/thumbnail/!1000x1000r/gravity/Center/crop/!1000x1000a0a0"},"translated":false},{"id":"jike-BB769515-C724-4652-8838-6AA32EC1A8DF:https://m.okjike.com/originalPosts/6b050bf638389f5993a22762","kind":"post","channel":null,"source_id":"jike-BB769515-C724-4652-8838-6AA32EC1A8DF","source_name":"刘飞Lufy","title":"","summary":"李沧东是不用枪炮刀剑，没有血流成河，但是可以不断拿刀扎入观众的导演。","body":"李沧东是不用枪炮刀剑，没有血流成河，但是可以不断拿刀扎入观众的导演。","url":"https://m.okjike.com/originalPosts/6b050bf638389f5993a22762","image":{"url":"https://cdnv2.ruguoapp.com/FonBM4odHK6WS4QzDhwAt6QIhOC7v3.jpg"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T12:00:54+08:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T06:09:34+08:00","lang":"zh","blogger":{"platform":"jike","handle":"BB769515-C724-4652-8838-6AA32EC1A8DF","display_name":"刘飞Lufy","media":[{"type":"image","url":"https://cdnv2.ruguoapp.com/FonBM4odHK6WS4QzDhwAt6QIhOC7v3.jpg"}],"quote":null,"avatar":"https://cdnv2.ruguoapp.com/FgT6fF6ajicCzhzz5Jmcxqhe0X5Sv3.jpg?imageMogr2/auto-orient/heic-exif/1/format/jpeg/thumbnail/!1000x1000r/gravity/Center/crop/!1000x1000a0a0"},"translated":false},{"id":"jike-83F8C091-4C46-43B7-B7AC-B90CD72255E7:https://m.okjike.com/originalPosts/6b04db3e320fd7e1b525c88b","kind":"post","channel":null,"source_id":"jike-83F8C091-4C46-43B7-B7AC-B90CD72255E7","source_name":"Barret李靖","title":"","summary":"昨天跟一个朋友聊天，他给我分享了自己创业成功的秘诀。他是一个极其乐观的人。 一般人在遇到挫折的时候，可能需要一两天，甚至更长时间才能恢复，但他几个小时就能走出来。 他说，低落的情绪是逃不过去的。遇到困难、挫折，或者做出了错误的决策，他也会陷入不开心的状态。他会任由这种情绪肆虐几个小时，然后开始冷静分析和复盘：哪里做得好，哪里做得不好，问题出在哪里，是自己的原因还是别人的原因，哪些能改变，哪些不能改…","body":"昨天跟一个朋友聊天，他给我分享了自己创业成功的秘诀。他是一个极其乐观的人。\n\n一般人在遇到挫折的时候，可能需要一两天，甚至更长时间才能恢复，但他几个小时就能走出来。\n\n他说，低落的情绪是逃不过去的。遇到困难、挫折，或者做出了错误的决策，他也会陷入不开心的状态。他会任由这种情绪肆虐几个小时，然后开始冷静分析和复盘：哪里做得好，哪里做得不好，问题出在哪里，是自己的原因还是别人的原因，哪些能改变，哪些不能改变，这件事情还要不要坚持。他会很快找到原因，做出下一步决策。\n\n失败是正常的，重要的是能够快速从失败中走出来。\n\n关于如何找到创业目标，他说自己主要依靠观察。他很擅长搞流量，而所谓的流量，本质上就是不断地发现和满足用户需求，找到用户真正需要什么，再借势做一些热点出来。\n\n因为关注的是需求，所以他很自然地会去思考市场的供需关系。他不怕失败，也愿意不断尝试。一旦找到供需关系中的机会，明确了要解决的问题和方法，他就会去研究行业 Top 1 的人是怎么做的。\n\n然后把对方当作自己奋斗的目标，要么跟他平起平坐，要么就超越他。\n\n他觉得，只要资源和能力全部到位，就没理由干不过对方。他说，这就是来自创业者的自信，创业者必须有这份自信。","url":"https://m.okjike.com/originalPosts/6b04db3e320fd7e1b525c88b","image":null,"published_at":"2026-11-24T08:33:02+08:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T06:09:34+08:00","lang":"zh","blogger":{"platform":"jike","handle":"83F8C091-4C46-43B7-B7AC-B90CD72255E7","display_name":"Barret李靖","media":[],"quote":null,"avatar":"https://cdnv2.ruguoapp.com/Fs-eSdFZY-o3eJCp506HPIEBqkXe?imageMogr2/auto-orient/heic-exif/1/format/jpeg/thumbnail/!1000x1000r/gravity/Center/crop/!1000x1000a0a0"},"translated":false},{"id":"jike-BB769515-C724-4652-8838-6AA32EC1A8DF:https://m.okjike.com/originalPosts/6b045c2a320fd7e1b51963fb","kind":"post","channel":null,"source_id":"jike-BB769515-C724-4652-8838-6AA32EC1A8DF","source_name":"刘飞Lufy","title":"","summary":"在天上飞了俩小时的工夫，英伟达涨回来了？","body":"在天上飞了俩小时的工夫，英伟达涨回来了？","url":"https://m.okjike.com/originalPosts/6b045c2a320fd7e1b51963fb","image":null,"published_at":"2026-11-23T23:30:50+08:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T06:09:34+08:00","lang":"zh","blogger":{"platform":"jike","handle":"BB769515-C724-4652-8838-6AA32EC1A8DF","display_name":"刘飞Lufy","media":[],"quote":null,"avatar":"https://cdnv2.ruguoapp.com/FgT6fF6ajicCzhzz5Jmcxqhe0X5Sv3.jpg?imageMogr2/auto-orient/heic-exif/1/format/jpeg/thumbnail/!1000x1000r/gravity/Center/crop/!1000x1000a0a0"},"translated":false},{"id":"jike-BB769515-C724-4652-8838-6AA32EC1A8DF:https://m.okjike.com/originalPosts/6b0428ea700ce05b6ad467ee","kind":"post","channel":null,"source_id":"jike-BB769515-C724-4652-8838-6AA32EC1A8DF","source_name":"刘飞Lufy","title":"","summary":"网约车司机遇到聊得来的乘客，会是充满遗憾的体验：越聊得来，越不舍得早点开到目的地；可越把对方当成朋友，又越需要送到得准时一点儿。","body":"网约车司机遇到聊得来的乘客，会是充满遗憾的体验：越聊得来，越不舍得早点开到目的地；可越把对方当成朋友，又越需要送到得准时一点儿。","url":"https://m.okjike.com/originalPosts/6b0428ea700ce05b6ad467ee","image":null,"published_at":"2026-11-23T19:52:10+08:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T06:09:34+08:00","lang":"zh","blogger":{"platform":"jike","handle":"BB769515-C724-4652-8838-6AA32EC1A8DF","display_name":"刘飞Lufy","media":[],"quote":null,"avatar":"https://cdnv2.ruguoapp.com/FgT6fF6ajicCzhzz5Jmcxqhe0X5Sv3.jpg?imageMogr2/auto-orient/heic-exif/1/format/jpeg/thumbnail/!1000x1000r/gravity/Center/crop/!1000x1000a0a0"},"translated":false},{"id":"jike-83F8C091-4C46-43B7-B7AC-B90CD72255E7:https://m.okjike.com/originalPosts/6b038c944eb280d3b3438c3f","kind":"post","channel":null,"source_id":"jike-83F8C091-4C46-43B7-B7AC-B90CD72255E7","source_name":"Barret李靖","title":"","summary":"人的一生中，不可控的东西太多了。有时候会因为一些突如其来的变化，或者难以处理的问题，内心郁结，胸口像是堵了什么东西，哽咽在喉，久久无法释怀。 但我们一次能解决的问题其实很有限，注意力也不可能持续分散在太多事情上。一次做好一件事，把精力聚焦在自己能够解决的问题上。同时，也要学会分辨，哪些事情是自己能够改变的，哪些是暂时无能为力的，哪些本身就是环境的问题。 想清楚了这些，慢慢也就释怀了。很多事情，尽力…","body":"人的一生中，不可控的东西太多了。有时候会因为一些突如其来的变化，或者难以处理的问题，内心郁结，胸口像是堵了什么东西，哽咽在喉，久久无法释怀。\n\n但我们一次能解决的问题其实很有限，注意力也不可能持续分散在太多事情上。一次做好一件事，把精力聚焦在自己能够解决的问题上。同时，也要学会分辨，哪些事情是自己能够改变的，哪些是暂时无能为力的，哪些本身就是环境的问题。\n\n想清楚了这些，慢慢也就释怀了。很多事情，尽力就好，不必事事都求一个结果。","url":"https://m.okjike.com/originalPosts/6b038c944eb280d3b3438c3f","image":null,"published_at":"2026-11-23T08:45:08+08:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T06:09:34+08:00","lang":"zh","blogger":{"platform":"jike","handle":"83F8C091-4C46-43B7-B7AC-B90CD72255E7","display_name":"Barret李靖","media":[],"quote":null,"avatar":"https://cdnv2.ruguoapp.com/Fs-eSdFZY-o3eJCp506HPIEBqkXe?imageMogr2/auto-orient/heic-exif/1/format/jpeg/thumbnail/!1000x1000r/gravity/Center/crop/!1000x1000a0a0"},"translated":false},{"id":"jike-83F8C091-4C46-43B7-B7AC-B90CD72255E7:https://m.okjike.com/originalPosts/6b0314f038389f59936dda39","kind":"post","channel":null,"source_id":"jike-83F8C091-4C46-43B7-B7AC-B90CD72255E7","source_name":"Barret李靖","title":"","summary":"AI 继续往前迭代，有三块内容会逐渐出现瓶颈： 1. 需求端不足； 2. 物理资源不足； 3. AI 无法独立承担最终的执行结果，因为它需要得到人的授权。 对于第三点，权限这个问题很容易让人产生疑惑。在企业内部，数字员工的执行存在一个非常致命的问题，就是 AI 无法代替人去做一些高风险的决策。那么，它的权限必然会被收缩。一旦权限被收缩，它可以执行的任务范围就一定会受到限制。 举个例子，当我们让 A…","body":"AI 继续往前迭代，有三块内容会逐渐出现瓶颈：\n\n1. 需求端不足；\n\n2. 物理资源不足；\n\n3. AI 无法独立承担最终的执行结果，因为它需要得到人的授权。\n\n对于第三点，权限这个问题很容易让人产生疑惑。在企业内部，数字员工的执行存在一个非常致命的问题，就是 AI 无法代替人去做一些高风险的决策。那么，它的权限必然会被收缩。一旦权限被收缩，它可以执行的任务范围就一定会受到限制。\n\n举个例子，当我们让 AI 去调查一些涉及企业内部敏感信息的事情时，它可以通过查询、推测，甚至利用系统漏洞等方式，把事情给做完。但实际上，这个过程存在很大的安全风险。AI 无法准确判断这些风险，却依然把事情做了。这就是过度授权带来的问题。\n\n反过来，当 AI 权限不足的时候，它又无法完成一些原本有能力完成的任务。也就是说，它的主动性会受到限制。\n\n另外，随着 AI 之间的协作越来越频繁，信息的交换、传递和相互交流，也会带来知识跨域和权限边界的问题。一个 AI 有权访问的信息，能否传递给另一个 AI？另一个 AI 又能否基于这些信息继续执行任务？这本身也是一个更加复杂的授权命题。","url":"https://m.okjike.com/originalPosts/6b0314f038389f59936dda39","image":null,"published_at":"2026-11-23T00:14:40+08:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T06:09:34+08:00","lang":"zh","blogger":{"platform":"jike","handle":"83F8C091-4C46-43B7-B7AC-B90CD72255E7","display_name":"Barret李靖","media":[],"quote":null,"avatar":"https://cdnv2.ruguoapp.com/Fs-eSdFZY-o3eJCp506HPIEBqkXe?imageMogr2/auto-orient/heic-exif/1/format/jpeg/thumbnail/!1000x1000r/gravity/Center/crop/!1000x1000a0a0"},"translated":false},{"id":"jike-7B1385A9-FCC9-4446-B8CE-472EAF6817B2:https://m.okjike.com/originalPosts/6b030290136b2761c686b45e","kind":"post","channel":null,"source_id":"jike-7B1385A9-FCC9-4446-B8CE-472EAF6817B2","source_name":"少楠Plidezus","title":"","summary":"三体都 20 年了啊？？啊？ 所以柜子里的书也有 20 年了？","body":"三体都 20 年了啊？？啊？\n\n所以柜子里的书也有 20 年了？","url":"https://m.okjike.com/originalPosts/6b030290136b2761c686b45e","image":{"url":"https://cdnv2.ruguoapp.com/lvOPa0LHutZFBDkSJUVGH19R_cK4v3.png?imageMogr2/meta-keep-list/ZXhpZixVc2VyQ29tbWVudA==/auto-orient/thumbnail/1080x%3E"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T22:56:16+08:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T06:09:34+08:00","lang":"zh","blogger":{"platform":"jike","handle":"7B1385A9-FCC9-4446-B8CE-472EAF6817B2","display_name":"少楠Plidezus","media":[{"type":"image","url":"https://cdnv2.ruguoapp.com/lvOPa0LHutZFBDkSJUVGH19R_cK4v3.png?imageMogr2/meta-keep-list/ZXhpZixVc2VyQ29tbWVudA==/auto-orient/thumbnail/1080x%3E"}],"quote":null,"avatar":"https://cdnv2.ruguoapp.com/FmtwuafewTTtdX3XezBXlN2OsOvDv3.jpg?imageMogr2/auto-orient/heic-exif/1/format/jpeg/thumbnail/!1000x1000r/gravity/Center/crop/!1000x1000a0a0"},"translated":false},{"id":"jike-bb668784-6bbc-456d-989c-1f8e90f6fd95:https://m.okjike.com/originalPosts/6b02e336320fd7e1b5f19ec0","kind":"post","channel":null,"source_id":"jike-bb668784-6bbc-456d-989c-1f8e90f6fd95","source_name":"王帅真","title":"","summary":"Arc～～～～😭 补药啊～～～～😭","body":"Arc～～～～😭\n\n补药啊～～～～😭","url":"https://m.okjike.com/originalPosts/6b02e336320fd7e1b5f19ec0","image":{"url":"https://cdnv2.ruguoapp.com/Fq-4Uv6gY96J4Sv3BV6XVO_RaLs_v3.png?imageMogr2/meta-keep-list/ZXhpZixVc2VyQ29tbWVudA==/auto-orient/thumbnail/1080x%3E"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T20:42:30+08:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T06:09:34+08:00","lang":"zh","blogger":{"platform":"jike","handle":"bb668784-6bbc-456d-989c-1f8e90f6fd95","display_name":"王帅真","media":[{"type":"image","url":"https://cdnv2.ruguoapp.com/Fq-4Uv6gY96J4Sv3BV6XVO_RaLs_v3.png?imageMogr2/meta-keep-list/ZXhpZixVc2VyQ29tbWVudA==/auto-orient/thumbnail/1080x%3E"}],"quote":null,"avatar":"https://cdnv2.ruguoapp.com/FruN09TgXgxjfRo8YYmQd7nAo0g9v3.jpg?imageMogr2/auto-orient/heic-exif/1/format/jpeg/thumbnail/!1000x1000r/gravity/Center/crop/!1000x1000a0a0"},"translated":false},{"id":"jike-83F8C091-4C46-43B7-B7AC-B90CD72255E7:https://m.okjike.com/originalPosts/6b02e17e136b2761c6832817","kind":"post","channel":null,"source_id":"jike-83F8C091-4C46-43B7-B7AC-B90CD72255E7","source_name":"Barret李靖","title":"","summary":"过去四年，AI 技术的发展有三条重要的主线： 1）技术能力的演进： 从语言生成、知识检索、复杂推理，到工具执行、环境操作、自主决策。 2）产品形态的演进： 从 Chatbot、Copilot、Agent，到 Personal Agent、数字员工，再到多 Agent 协同的自主生产系统。 3）商业价值的迁移： 从出售模型能力、知识库和软件订阅，逐渐转向出售工作成果、数字劳动力和持续性的业务服务。…","body":"过去四年，AI 技术的发展有三条重要的主线：\n\n1）技术能力的演进： 从语言生成、知识检索、复杂推理，到工具执行、环境操作、自主决策。\n\n2）产品形态的演进： 从 Chatbot、Copilot、Agent，到 Personal Agent、数字员工，再到多 Agent 协同的自主生产系统。\n\n3）商业价值的迁移： 从出售模型能力、知识库和软件订阅，逐渐转向出售工作成果、数字劳动力和持续性的业务服务。\n\n这三条主线背后有一个共同的规律：每一次模型能力上限的提升，都会消灭一些稀缺性，同时又创造出新的稀缺性。","url":"https://m.okjike.com/originalPosts/6b02e17e136b2761c6832817","image":null,"published_at":"2026-11-22T20:35:10+08:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T06:09:34+08:00","lang":"zh","blogger":{"platform":"jike","handle":"83F8C091-4C46-43B7-B7AC-B90CD72255E7","display_name":"Barret李靖","media":[],"quote":null,"avatar":"https://cdnv2.ruguoapp.com/Fs-eSdFZY-o3eJCp506HPIEBqkXe?imageMogr2/auto-orient/heic-exif/1/format/jpeg/thumbnail/!1000x1000r/gravity/Center/crop/!1000x1000a0a0"},"translated":false},{"id":"jike-35224A78-8B11-469E-B307-16B58688FBEC:https://m.okjike.com/originalPosts/6b02e060dcc0973514f69cc7","kind":"post","channel":null,"source_id":"jike-35224A78-8B11-469E-B307-16B58688FBEC","source_name":"艾逗笔","title":"","summary":"找到 1000 个用户来用 https://weclaw.im","body":"找到 1000 个用户来用 https://weclaw.im","url":"https://m.okjike.com/originalPosts/6b02e060dcc0973514f69cc7","image":{"url":"https://cdnv2.ruguoapp.com/FiSqCZv2lI6ueu5Qm7_0zq773zvWv3.png?imageMogr2/meta-keep-list/ZXhpZixVc2VyQ29tbWVudA==/auto-orient/thumbnail/1080x%3E"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T20:30:24+08:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T06:09:34+08:00","lang":"zh","blogger":{"platform":"jike","handle":"35224A78-8B11-469E-B307-16B58688FBEC","display_name":"艾逗笔","media":[{"type":"image","url":"https://cdnv2.ruguoapp.com/FiSqCZv2lI6ueu5Qm7_0zq773zvWv3.png?imageMogr2/meta-keep-list/ZXhpZixVc2VyQ29tbWVudA==/auto-orient/thumbnail/1080x%3E"}],"quote":null,"avatar":"https://